{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-01_end","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-01","title":"別離之夜","storyCode":"7-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"445daefc97055919c90475d0d2091a5b5047436aa39d93447d72c4636cc1ecbf","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"魏彥吾的辦公室中，對事態的商討演變成了爭執。\n質問，質疑，責難，失望，堅持，歎息。最終，陳選擇了孤軍奮戰。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"narration","text":"魏彥吾辦公室 6:30 p.m."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，魏先生。三十二小時後，核心城將與龍門相撞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"它的城邦識別碼沒有改換，這意味著切爾諾伯格這座移動城邦的核心部分，仍是烏薩斯領土的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦我們攻擊了核心城，就等同於對烏薩斯宣戰......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動想以這種方式挾持烏薩斯，無異於異想天開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生的反應稍顯平靜了些。也許在您看來，烏薩斯幾乎是個愛好和平的國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯的擴張建立在它對財富、疆土與發展的渴望上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有利可圖，數十年前的烏薩斯帝國會毫無疑問地策動一場戰爭，哪怕這場戰爭的敵人是整片大地也在所不惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，向炎挑起戰爭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"數百年來大炎從未對外宣戰，但這不意味著大炎缺乏贏取戰爭的能力。不如說，窮兵黷武的國家並不能理解炎的繁榮究竟從何而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"兩敗俱傷的大戰過後，大炎自然需要許多時日去調養生息，但有著嚴重內政問題的烏薩斯卻會受到更沉重的打擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯已經不再是過往那隻龐然惡物，只有蠢人和瘋子才會發動一場損失甚巨、無利可圖，且必定失敗的戰爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生，據我所知，這兩種人在任何國家與城邦都不少見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"剔除醞釀災難的種種因素，既是我的職責之一，也是烏薩斯的帝國議會的職能所在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦帝國議會做出答覆，我們就會立刻實施各項措施，停止切爾諾伯格核心城的運作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"之後的外交事端，交給外交官們去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只負責把危機消滅在搖籃裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你很信任對方，哪怕對方是烏薩斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我很信任利益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"接連的戰爭帶來了慘痛的教訓，縱使烏薩斯成功自戰爭中攫取了大量的資源，它卻無力對抗接踵而至的內部腐蝕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"它沒能消化它征服的居民與土地，任何國家都無法同時承受叛亂的劇痛與民眾相互仇視產生的劇毒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的烏薩斯帝國只是具外強中乾的腐屍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是魏先生相信烏薩斯會遵循利益的走向，履行與你之間的協定的理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我和帝國議會議長間沒有任何或口頭或成文的協議。我們只是同樣還保留著少許理智。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月，替我發送消息，我需要第一時間得到兩方的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......文月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡還有一份消息。只屬於你的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生和阿米婭小姐，還有小陳......你們也聽一聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"好好聽完，你會改變看法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你再拒絕她們，我們就真的要孤立無援了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“魏長官，接到這條消息意味著你必須立刻採取行動。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼......是我的信使。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“接下來的訊息已經過法術加密。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"渾厚的男聲錄音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“魏先生，第三和第四集團軍出現了鬆動。我們沒能查到事情的源頭。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"渾厚的男聲錄音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我甚至沒法推測誰是主謀。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"渾厚的男聲錄音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“他們在議會席上竊竊私語，嘲笑著我無力取勝的醜態，我卻找不出追究他們責任的證據。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"渾厚的男聲錄音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“如果在切爾諾伯格發生了什麼，您應該傾力阻止。否則事情將一發不可收拾。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"渾厚的男聲錄音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“您仍然有足夠的智慧與能力，去將事端消滅在源頭處。我們無能為力的事情，只能交給您。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......讓我聽完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"之後是信使的獨白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"他是我的信使。讓我聽完。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"渾厚的男聲錄音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我沒能見到維特議長，他派來與我聯絡的信使也遭到了不明勢力的追殺。幸虧這位信使安然無恙。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"渾厚的男聲錄音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“這位信使連夜溜出聖駿堡，有人暗中為他提供了方便，我認為烏薩斯的內部勢力正在相互拉鋸。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"渾厚的男聲錄音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“在這之後的路途中，我多次遭遇襲擊，也有許多身份不明的人嘗試保護我。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"維特的勢力幫助了他們......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"渾厚的男聲錄音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我已經抵達了烏拉爾裂谷，徵用了腳下的發報站。之後會發生什麼事，我也不清楚。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"渾厚的男聲錄音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“真希望回龍門喝點家鄉的茶。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"他現在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"生死未卜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"聽上去帝國議長正要袖手旁觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"帝國議會雖然是烏薩斯的中心......但切爾諾伯格現在所處的區域，恰好是烏薩斯的邊疆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"邊疆一直處於軍隊和殘餘舊貴族的勢力範圍之內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"軍隊沒有在大叛亂後繼續參與類似行動的機會，但感染者有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所有被嚴密監視的舊貴族都沒法策劃切爾諾伯格的災難，但感染者能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，大多數未經訓練的整合運動感染者，並不能與軍警和被蒙在鼓裡的切爾諾伯格常備防暴武裝抗衡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但天災能。切爾諾伯格沒有提前拆分地塊，面對天災的襲擊，切爾諾伯格無計可施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動需要提前潛入這座城市來阻止城市武裝力量的糾集，軍隊也可以對他們的潛入視而不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門和我們提前預見了整合運動的動向，近衛局也策劃了針對整合運動的全面圍剿，但切爾諾伯格......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕到今天為止，切爾諾伯格，或者說烏薩斯和他們的喉舌......一聲未發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"謎底揭曉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"無視這座城市的價值，無視所有居民的死活，烏薩斯把切爾諾伯格拱手送給了整合運動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而已經被感染的，已經在死亡邊緣徘徊太久的感染者，無懼死亡的感染者們，將在天災後接管這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"他們根本不需要出手，他們只需要......讓道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"他們只需要允許這件事情發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"即使這樣，切爾諾伯格遭到天災侵襲後，只是個缺乏資源的死城......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者自然會湧向龍門！無論整合運動是誰在操縱，這一切簡直，簡直都水到渠成......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"傳令。立刻阻攔監察司，使用武力也無所謂。做好一切開戰準備，我要龍門保證能確定無誤地癱瘓核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"在核心城停下之前，不准有一絲讓消息傳遞出去的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你要主動開戰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月，在龍門經歷了這麼多的你應該清楚。胞弟絕不會允許我主動與烏薩斯開戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪怕讓我們獲得優勢的代價是這座龍門城的一切。我必須主動出擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"主動開戰意味著開戰者將必定受到他國的敵視，也更難與其他國家結交戰時盟友關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"先進入宣戰狀態的國家，很可能會陷入孤立無援的境地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這......最糟糕的是無論真相是什麼樣，也要戰爭過後才會有人去查證......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"有些國家也並不在乎真相，只是想要一個藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，魏先生，我相信和平依然可以依靠和平的外交手段去締造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希女士，感謝你的建議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"只是很可惜，我和維特就已經是這兩個國家最後的和平手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"無論我們的敵人是帝國第三集團軍還是烏薩斯皇帝，就算我們必定能夠贏得這場戰爭，這場戰爭也終歸會發生。已經沒有和平的可能了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果維特不敢透過官方管道指責或制止這一系列行為，說明他會因此被群起而攻之，甚至適得其反。他是政客，他必定自私。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"把他逼到這個地步，帝國的官僚結構可能已經處於半癱瘓的狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"兩個集團軍能要脅整個烏薩斯，卻要脅不了不在烏薩斯境內的龍門。龍門理應有緊急應對另一座移動城市的措施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的話，現在疏散城市已經來不及了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不停下核心城，龍門將會在衝撞中毀之一旦。之後的領土衝突，同樣會孕育無盡的災難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可想要停止核心城......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦我們發射艦炮或派遣特殊隊伍進行斬首，便是向烏薩斯宣戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"原本維特可以遏制住的事態，被切爾諾伯格核心城完全切斷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"一座切斷了所有通訊，除了識別碼以外毫無交流的孤城，想要怎麼解釋都可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所說，醫生。只有龍門能做些什麼，只有我們在面對切爾諾伯格的核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生，請三思。開戰的後果依然嚴重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"一場戰爭沒法被輕描淡寫地帶過，但另一個後果，對於龍門來說，只會更加嚴重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生。羅德島......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......陳小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"小陳？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我去解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你是龍門的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以脫離龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警司，不要自詡有志之士。這不是你的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果龍門需要一個叛徒，我可以來當。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾，我對你和你的城市，你這座金玉其外敗絮其中的城市......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"已經厭倦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"在你對貧民區出手的時候，我就已經不屬於這座城市了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不要在這個時候與我爭辯這種對錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可是他們做錯了什麼，你為什麼要這麼對待他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......“他們做錯了什麼？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳小姐，他們做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我：整合運動選擇潛伏在哪裡，又是從哪裡潛入了這座城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你信任貧民窟的居民，他們是不是同樣信任你？這種信任究竟在哪裡有所體現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"除了你的線人和林舸瑞的耳目之外，有任何其他一個貧民區的居民向你們報告了“感染者正在滲透他們的聚居地”之類的事實嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"事情發展得很快！沒收到線報並不是誰的過錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否收到哪怕一條民間情報？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"有，或是沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"一條也沒有。一個人也沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人相信你們。他們寧可信任外來的暴力煽動者和感染者，也不相信為他們提供生存條件的鼠王和近衛局高級警司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他們更可能是遭到了整合運動的脅迫，整合運動的感染者有著大量使用暴力的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那他們是否想過，龍門從未對他們使用過暴力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會怪罪他們相互扶持的行為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至認為，如果他們不支持身邊的感染者，依然仇視著身邊的感染者，那麼貧民區會自取滅亡，不必等到今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，他們可以反對整合運動，他們可以與鼠王的人一同抵禦滲透，他們可以向你們尋求幫助——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不信任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"對。他們不信任你們。即使你為這些人付出了無數的時間和資源，他們卻從沒有信任過你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我們早該讓近衛局進駐貧民區！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"拒絕近衛局進駐貧民區的是他們。數次謀害了我近衛局雇員的是他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"在我和林舸瑞用盡辦法，終於消滅了貧民區裡的危險罪犯與異國惡徒時，對我們戰士的犧牲不屑一顧的，也是他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"是龍門拒絕了他們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我，陳小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"看著我的眼睛，回答我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"問題不出在他們身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳小姐，那麼這裡出問題的是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經許多次警告過你，我允許你保留自己的想法和理念......前提是你不能被它影響到你的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局的職責是保衛龍門。特別督查組的職責是指導近衛局保衛龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你傾力保護的貧民區已經成了龍門的漏洞，更可能成為龍門的敗著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"他們中被整合運動利用的感染者，製造了龍門攻防戰的幌子，讓龍門對切爾諾伯格失去了警戒心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"令我們驅除整合運動的戰術規劃成了核心城趁虛而入的弱點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"而他們中的非感染者，卻對一切袖手旁觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果龍門因此陷落，他們就是元兇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果龍門成為了戰爭的開端，生靈塗炭，血流成河，該是誰來承擔責任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多的災難，只因為這幾塊城區......只因為我們沒有及時採取措施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你的措施難道就是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡出問題的是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"是龍門拒絕了他們嗎？不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"是他們拒絕了龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想拋棄他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"短視與漠然毀掉了他們自己。我沒有任何理由再去支持這些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳。我們都沾染了無數的錯誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"錯誤是必然的，理所應當的。我們只是該彌補錯誤，或者暫時地掩蓋它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我做不到的，總有人可以去做到。只是現在，我依然有我必須要做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"錯誤？必須做的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，你剛才說的一切，我都明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者只要在城邦裡存在就是一種錯誤，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......冥頑不靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警司，我與你說過的一切，我都記得。做現在的你該做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾，我該做的，近衛局該做的，就是指出誰是錯的，然後解決掉那個錯誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"現在看來，按你的定義，錯的只會是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，我也是那個錯誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我就是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"小陳？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"已經沒必要再瞞下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......三年來，你一直在對別人隱瞞我感染者的身份。現在，既然感染者在這座城市裡沒有容身之處，那我也不應該有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"胡言亂語！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我和她都是感染者。我不屬於這裡。我有我該做的事，我也不會再犯下更多錯誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我能阻止她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“別有愧疚，我都清楚。我們是結義兄弟，對吧？兄弟可是......知根知底。”\n義親相殘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我是感染者，也是龍門的叛徒。只有我是適合做這個的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我恨你。我也恨她們。明明我該愛你們的，而今我卻全都恨。”\n血親相殘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"既然走到今天這一步，我們就都只能繼續走下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“為什麼是我？為什麼要是我？在這位子上有誰會安穩？為什麼要是我去坐？”\n至親相殘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，你要是走出這間辦公室，陳暉潔......你會變成龍門的敵人，你將永遠都不能再踏入龍門哪怕一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你我十年來所有的努力......都要白廢。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的努力......在你做出那種事的時候就已經浪費了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"龍門城即將陷入火海，一場大戰迫在眉睫，你有你的手段，我有我的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唯一的區別是，我不是你這種人。我不會把任何人當成“錯誤”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不能讓這座城市淪陷，卻也不會做無謀的突襲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"權位自始至終也只是工具。你如果要用這個工具去修整土地，就要符合它的期望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要嘲笑自己，陳督察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你嘲笑它，就只是嘲笑自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我教育你，是讓你去改變它，我一直希望你能去改變這片土地的渴求，不再只是繁榮，不再只是一味地昌盛繁榮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那它改變了嗎？它能被改變得了嗎？我所努力的一切當真是有意義的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即使現在不能，它以後也必須能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"由你去讓它能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"接待員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等，等等！你們是誰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"接待員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在不能進去......侍衛呢？！侍衛在哪裡！有人闖入！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公，我們去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"請讓我們去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你不該來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，呵呵，呵呵哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾，你的真面目就這麼被輕鬆揭開了嗎？你的私兵就這麼大喇喇地出現在你的辦公室裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"陳家小姐，龍門有難！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這話聽起來很有責任感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但你們說的話，我一句都不會信。你們有什麼要和他說的，請便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公......我們可自削面目，輕裝入城，襲殺主謀，力阻撞擊！事成之後，我們必以身殉城，不使魏公煩憂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了魏彥吾？讓我去或者讓他們去，很難嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼在殺人的時候雷厲風行，在該救人的時候就變得優柔寡斷了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這次......是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"上次，也是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒指望能好好道別一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，魏彥吾。雖然我想過很多次了，但我也沒指望能好好向誰道別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"文月小姐，我媽媽以前對你那樣，我很過意不去。謝謝你，謝謝這麼多年來對我的照顧。我一直把你當親人看待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......小陳？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警司！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不再是了。這個近衛局的徽章，還給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——拿下她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"要在這裡先廝殺一場？要決定誰才是真正的叛徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警司，大敵當前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"作為感染者，我天生就是你們的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"收手吧！否則，不可怪我下手無情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你們對誰手下留情過？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不要用這種冠冕堂皇的口氣說你們根本就不可能去做的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公，當心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"赤霄，振氣！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“彥吾兄弟，如果這劍是用來屠龍的話，德拉克算不算？”\n“也算？那我是不是該小心點了，哈哈......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然是......法術亂流？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生，快退後，我來擋下法術！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不......能量的結層只會被那種切割性的法術撕碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"她沒有瞄準你我，現在，立即退出可能被她法術波及的範圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"法術開始伸展了。後退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——出！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"斬龍劍，出鞘了一瞬？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"呲......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"用手臂就擋下了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"相當銳利！警司，你的劍術相較從前，確有進境！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......火鍛源石。赤霄嗎？他們竟然還在鑄造這種武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這把劍，醫生，難道是專門鑄造來對抗能量法術的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......最初陳長官不讓我看那把劍，也是設想了與我為敵的情況嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公，警司確實篤定了心思。我可能沒法擋下第二擊。需要我搏命嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"我死，定可把陳督察留在龍門，雖不能保她四肢健全，但一定能留她生路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——不可。你，撤步。不可直攖其鋒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"我立刻聯繫其他弟兄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"想叫後援？赤霄——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"停手！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"暉潔，你想使雲裂之劍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了，你的劍術和你的法術是誰教你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來不曾想過要廢掉你的劍術，但我不會在此時此刻假意仁慈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"莫要逼我，陳暉潔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你儘管動手好了，魏大人。赤霄在我手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"給我赤霄的這一天，你是不是覺得我會殺你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會用它來殺你，魏彥吾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得你在保護我，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽是憂鬱而死的。塔露拉是被擄走的。我是因為職位染上礦石病的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得你做的這一切都在保護我，是嗎？是因為你的愧疚，還是因為你對自己權謀的自信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想任何悲劇再發生在我面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"胡扯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾，這把劍有該殺的人......也有該守住的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她真的想毀掉這座龍門城......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不。你不能去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我從沒想過要在這裡戰勝你和黑蓑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是，魏彥吾，出口可不是只有門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"窗戶？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳暉潔，別做傻事，這裡離地面有數百米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這也不是我第一第二次走窗戶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳暉潔，你絕不能見她！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......小陳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能重蹈覆轍！你不該走上我們的老路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一定還要有一個人為這座城市而死，那個人只可以是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......舅舅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不......魏彥吾。今天起，我們恩怨兩消。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"玻璃破碎的聲音響起，陳仰面墜下了高樓。\n龍門城主高聲咆哮，披著黑色雨披的人利箭般躍向了破窗。\n可陳已經下定決心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彥吾"]},{"speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","aliases":["文月"]}]}
